# MY AI Shortcut — environment template.
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your own values.
#
# Most users need NOTHING here: run `hermes model`, sign in to Nous Portal,
# and the free tier or Plus works out of the box.
#
# Or bring your own provider key, e.g.:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# Never commit a filled-in .env — it is git-ignored.
